@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Index
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### List Tarefas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tarefas
Accept: application/json

### Get Tarefa by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tarefas/0
Accept: application/json

### Concluir Tarefa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tarefas/0
Accept: application/json

### Excluir Tarefa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tarefas/0
Accept: application/json

### Create Tarefa
POST {{baseUrl}}/tarefas?titulo=Criare%20uma%20nova%20tarefa&descricao=Esta%20%C3%A9%20a%20descri%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20da%20nova%20tarefa